# TokenGuard Quick Start

**TokenGuard** prevents LLM API 429 (rate limit) errors by tracking token usage and throttling requests before they exceed quotas.

## 3-Step Usage (Python)

```python
from token_guard import TokenGuard

# 1. Initialize the guard
guard = TokenGuard()

# 2. Check if request can proceed
decision = guard.check_request("Your prompt here", model="gemini-3-flash")

# 3. Handle the action
if decision.action == "proceed":
    response = call_api("Your prompt here")
    guard.record_usage(decision.estimated_tokens, model="gemini-3-flash")
elif decision.action == "wait":
    time.sleep(decision.wait_seconds)
elif decision.action == "block":
    print(f"Blocked: {decision.reason}")
```

